{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/SteamText_1.png?t=1750509276\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/Latest_10.gif?t=1750509276\" /></div>Step into a brutal world where humanoid animal warriors battle to save their realm from an invading cosmic force. Embody the strength of tribal heroes as you defend Feralia Terra, a once-thriving land now on the brink of annihilation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/SteamText_2.png?t=1750509276\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/Latest_11.gif?t=1750509276\" /></div>Unleash your feral instincts in visceral melee combat, explore corrupted landscapes, and unravel a cosmic mystery threatening all life. Reclaim your honor and restore balance to the realm.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/SteamText_3.png?t=1750509276\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/ArtnrollGames_CLASH_HOFT_1_1.gif?t=1750509276\" /></div>Traverse corrupted lush forests, highlands, villages and plains, uncovering secrets, lore, and crafting resources. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/SteamText_4.png?t=1750509276\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/ArtnrollGames_CLASH_HOFT_1.gif?t=1750509276\" /></div>Scavenge, craft, and adapt to harsh environments while battling twisted wildlife and cosmic horrors. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/SteamText_6.png?t=1750509276\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/ArtnrollGames_CLASH_HOFT_1_2.gif?t=1750509276\" /></div>Face enemies, from corrupted beasts to cosmic abominations, in challenging multiphase encounters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/SteamText_5.png?t=1750509276\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/ArtnrollGames_CLASH_HOFT_1_3.gif?t=1750509276\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/SteamText_7.png?t=1750509276\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2512550?t=1750509276","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750509276","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/247d35d59768f5989eb7881079cf5df89d3350e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750509276","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/247d35d59768f5989eb7881079cf5df89d3350e4/capsule_184x